nd: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> I got suspicious when he started describing Heru in particularly vicious/jealous terms. Like - I could buy the new invented conflict he was pitching between Anpu and the rest of the Pantheon - but that clearly personal grudge against Heru started ringing a pretty familiar bell<br /> <br /> Also, while I could see someone without the intended reveal just choosing that color as an oversight, so I wasn't sure - the fact that her eyes glow RED is a pretty big flag in an Kemetic context.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">For me it was the form he chose, first and foremost. I looked at that, that was not a jackal. I went &quot;Hey, didn't I hear Set was salawa-headed? A 'relative of the dog?'&quot; And I googled it, the resemblance sealed the deal. Giving powers of physical might, not being too good at magic (as opposed to the guy who invented mummification) and talking about storms- Yeah, that was not Anpu. I mean, I don't agree with Sobek on a lot of things, but even a kid's cartoon knows that Anubis is the dead-things-and-jackals guy, Set is the storms-and-destruction guy. I guess in between the fights and the doubts of trustworthiness, she's been too busy to google &quot;Anubis?&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12689-creepyshutin","name":"CreepyShutIn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12689_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T06:44:31-07:00","id":1146320,"title":"","content":"Just read the whole (current) thing in one go.<br /> <br /> Seems good, so far. What time does it update?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T08:14:01-07:00","id":1146339,"title":"","content":"Mondays and Thurdays - more than that depends on the creator, (its created by a single person) i check it usually at about 10pm UK time (on those days) along with the rest of the webcomics i read","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyx